## maistro-engine — universal agent bootstrap

- Start with `AGENTS.md` and `docs/agent-guidance/README.md`.
- Use progressive disclosure: load only the domain index and atomic guidance applicable to the current task; do not preload the ADR/spec corpus.
- Never commit secrets or `.env` files, and never hand-edit `.cursor/rules/imported/`.
- Surface conflicting guidance instead of silently preserving historical behavior; pre-1.0 work follows the intended 1.0 architecture and canonical atomic standards.
